  "steps": [
    "Blanch the spinach and mix it well as a paste in a blender.",
    "Heat oil in a pan.",
    "Add jeera, ginger, green chilli and spinach paste and masala and salt.",
    "Mix it well for 3 min high flame and besan flour and mix it well into a dough.",
    "Now add grated paneer in a bowl along with pepper powder, coriander leaf and salt.",
    "Make it as ball and stuff it into the spinach dough and make it as a whole ball.",
    "Now add one by one slowly into a steamer.",
    "Steam it for 3 to 4 mins.",
    "Now heat oil in a pan and add cardamom, cloves and bay leaf along with tomato, walnuts, masala, Kasoori methi, salt and water.",
    "Mix it all well in high heat for 1 min and cover it and cook it in medium flame for 4 mins.",
    "Now transfer in a plate and let it come to room temperature.",
    "Now transfer into a mixer jar and blend it into a paste and add in a kadai along with jeera.",
    "Mix it well for 3 mins in high flame.",
    "Now pour it in a plate and cut the spinach paneer balls and add it into this gravy and enjoy it!"
  ],
